{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ac1b5c1394925882d3f7ed43139a7ab62cba0bae434792ca08add67e92314714", "ja": "――スチームパンク映画　シークレットエピソード――", "zh": "——蒸汽朋克电影　秘密章节——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "fe8d9602b2cff7a71ce0b77f3de839a1cf5f2421f0d51039ad21f3d92b159993", "ja": "納品かんりょ～！\nありがとねタマキ、手伝ってくれて！", "zh": "交货完成～！谢谢你帮忙哦，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "84cea082f999427de6d531216deb85794f94ee4cbbb5a887c9bde28d5779e981", "ja": "別に、当たり前だし……。それよりお客さん、\n喜んでたね。どこに頼んでも直らなかったのにって。", "zh": "也没什么，本来就该这样……话说回来，客人挺开心的呢。明明找谁都修不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "96b7529b92fed28e30540f983925cf33f17adc5651393aa8790a64227b9031ac", "ja": "そりゃあ私にかかれば、蒸気式自動掘削アーンドお掃除\nアーンド肩もみ機の修理なんて、指先ひとつだからね！", "zh": "那当然啦，交给我，蒸汽式自动挖掘——还有清扫——还有肩部按摩机的修理，动动一根手指就搞定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "83fbfd773f34f4623235db05bc2d2a8faf596cee5c393921f0577c65e33773b8", "ja": "使用人ロボのメンテもしたから、お礼もはずんで\nもらえたし。帰りに夕飯買ってこっか。何がいい？", "zh": "我还给佣人机器人做了维护，所以也拿到了丰厚的谢礼。回去的时候顺便买晚饭吧。你想吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "d30bb8ec84b8fcbd7955c908ee516b46425d107e9c6ebefce1f4346ec9df9b4f", "ja": "……肉まん以外。", "zh": "……肉包以外都行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "94c4e85ad8520cfffe047a568a946ff1fdc6d62c24e4aa31fbe75b5c2f6be010", "ja": "悪かった！　ここ最近のご飯は肉まんばかりで\nほんっとーに悪かった！", "zh": "对不起！最近这段时间的饭菜净是肉包，\n真的非常对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "f23eabe495b9b53d6ab7c1a8e64a0a437ce745d723c75d49f57ea95718cc669c", "ja": "でも、おかげでおいしい肉まんレシピも編み出せたし？\n肉まん製造機も調子よさげだしね？", "zh": "不过，多亏了这个，我还研究出了好吃的肉包配方嘛？\n肉包制造机的状态看起来也不错，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "178964136300bacc08803a8e122eb41b2dd1f73d05d6911d6c6dafe706d63fc9", "ja": "そうだ、セリカの屋台に寄っていこっか！　そんで、\n一緒に何か見繕って……お肉がいい？　お魚がいい？", "zh": "对了，要不要顺便去趟星梨花的摊位！然后一起挑点什么……要肉的？还是鱼的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "85788ba22e8250966e167a31f7aa96caea23afe6dc0036af2f503b282c987bcb", "ja": "肉まんが駄目とは言ってないよ、\nおかげでセリカも仕事ができたんだし……。", "zh": "我也没说肉包不行啊，\n多亏了这个，星梨花才能工作的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "01514d9c2bedea6937e7b61ca5fd6f657a4293509bca2288b1b8c9b2f90ecce9", "ja": "……アカネには、感謝してる。\n私たちを、拾ってくれて。", "zh": "……我很感谢茜。\n谢谢你收留了我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "497e8726cb70c5db9c2d7156ac8f51faa78526378ba9bf9bdd1a23f31f968a5e", "ja": "うそ、タマキが優しい。おまけに可愛い！\nこれが思春期ってやつ？　もっかい言って！？", "zh": "骗人，环居然这么温柔。而且还很可爱！\n这就是所谓的思春期吗？能再说一次吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "a1c0d4372298cf143b4695a0189132e154586fab96264beb39eed16d0fdc3e42", "ja": "し、知らないよ！　別にいつも通りだし！\nそれより、広場行くんでしょ！", "zh": "我、我才不知道呢！和平时没什么两样！\n比起这个，不是要去广场吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "4df9e0b900d1db556618c986d7c82beefe75f827dc498de4ba93fa1dd04b0608", "ja": "あ、そだね。でも、もっかい言うのは\n道すがらでもいいんだぞ♪", "zh": "啊，对哦。不过，再说一次的话，\n路上说也行啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "22fa74cb6c27c03b15f013c5576691f3d86d98f1b96bc85f760bd681a98f975b", "ja": "ていうか私もさ、感謝してるからね？　人間の家族が\nできるなんて、思ってなかったし……、え？", "zh": "话说回来，我也很感谢你哦？我可没想过自己还能拥有\n人类的家人……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1015_se", "source_sha256": "615a64b05785eac5e8046cb3139f0d4583dbcdc700e7eeb2dcd5e729dd5e6ca7", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ……！", "zh": "沙、沙、沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1016_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "3b6f742f9651755cf0c0d487110355d2297e19e0484fa60bc3aa2c4ba21cafc9", "ja": "アカネというのは、お前だな。\n今すぐに来てもらおう。", "zh": "你就是叫茜的那个人吧。  \n现在就过来一趟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "f09e8b42a648fc23e6c129fcde200ac97d550e844ce7606d3d10413360e9ba83", "ja": "タマキ、逃げるよ！", "zh": "环，快逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "2becc84b754753c230369ce35b00878b076e40c7a6465a9e9e1b42c2b14e5764", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……。アカネ、今の、\n政府のロボットだよね？　どうして？", "zh": "呼、呼……茜，刚才那个，是政府的机器人吧？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "8c6bd97f25916e61e7d420728e92a51469c754d2d64ba72dc9d025803e78b1c3", "ja": "すぐに追いつかれるな……。\nタマキ、これを！", "zh": "马上就要被追上了……环，接住这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "9f3f2a17f0729935eda803aaa1e7f4a825d1ee665e9baaae249db43463bf2f30", "ja": "！　この石はなに？", "zh": "！这块石头是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "78003129460ca319b5134063b661a355b3289d87df6f0805deeb16f69c72004d", "ja": "奴らはこれがなきゃ私に手出しできない。\n誰にも見せないで。隠してて！", "zh": "那些家伙没有这个就不能对我动手。\n千万别给任何人看。藏好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1022_se", "source_sha256": "615a64b05785eac5e8046cb3139f0d4583dbcdc700e7eeb2dcd5e729dd5e6ca7", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ……！", "zh": "沙、沙、沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1023_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "8068bec5a4c1d234c85454ca325cf1a7db8c56f7c07f9c5dab97ab045a1d4cff", "ja": "逃げても無駄だ。おとなしく従え。さもなくば……", "zh": "逃跑也没用。老老实实服从吧。否则……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "e08d3e2877b4ecb7f92e167b0606be4467819b7890e860d0828d77d5c8a65c1a", "ja": "オーケーオーケー、降参だよ。今行くってば。\n……タマキ、私は大丈夫だから。セリカにも伝えてね。", "zh": "好啦好啦，我投降。都说了这就过去嘛。\n……环，我没事的。也帮我告诉星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "fa224cdca2e0a0e2c46cec02627be5acfbc54fffc7987241ada8d05c35ba0bfe", "ja": "そんな、アカネー……！", "zh": "怎么会，茜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0554_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "f97f2664df9069947c215d541f79c3875fec0c82189cfd715b7edf932f0d4ea9", "ja": "（ごめんタマキ。でも、いつか絶対、帰るからね。\nタマキもセリカも、私の家族だから。……ね？）", "zh": "（对不起，环。不过，我总有一天绝对会回去的。环和星梨花都是我的家人……对吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
